        },
        {
          "word": " verses.",
          "start": 1878.36,
          "end": 1878.46,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And then, the Bismillah has a zero, and then 1, 2, and so on to the end of the Sura. And you go like this to the end of the Quran.",
