        },
        {
          "word": " fruit.",
          "start": 4554.44,
          "end": 4554.8,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You recognize the good person or the bad person by their actions, their words, what they produce.",
