          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " wrong?\"",
          "start": 5558.48,
          "end": 5558.48,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, it seems like the ego is the obstacle.",
      "start": 5558.54,
      "end": 5558.88,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 5558.54,
