          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And it has to be idol worship.",
      "start": 5558.88,
      "end": 5558.88,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " obstacle.",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " it",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " has",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " be",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " idol",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because why will a person resent another person?",
      "start": 5558.88,
      "end": 5558.88,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " worship.",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Because",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " why",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " will",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " a",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " person",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " resent",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " another",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because they think he's better than them.",
      "start": 5558.88,
      "end": 5558.88,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " person?",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Because",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " they",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " think",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " he's",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " better",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " than",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When they think he's better than them, that's idol worship.",
      "start": 5558.88,
      "end": 5558.88,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " them.",
