          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You forget the message. And all they concern is \"you're Kazzab that you're a messenger of God.\"",
      "start": 5558.88,
      "end": 5558.88,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
