          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly"
        },
        {
          "word": " message,",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly"
        },
        {
          "word": " examine",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They find that the message is worship God alone. Well, they reject it and then they go.",
      "start": 5558.88,
      "end": 5558.88,
      "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " it.",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly"
        },
        {
          "word": " They",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly"
        },
        {
          "word": " find",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly"
        },
        {
          "word": " that",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
