          "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They think they got away with it.",
      "start": 5558.88,
      "end": 5558.88,
      "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " go.",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly"
        },
        {
          "word": " They",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly"
        },
        {
          "word": " think",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly"
        },
        {
          "word": " they",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly"
        },
        {
          "word": " got",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly"
        },
        {
          "word": " away",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly"
        },
        {
          "word": " with",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Then, when they get their retribution, they say \"why is this happening to me?\" And they cry.",
      "start": 5558.88,
      "end": 5558.88,
      "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " it.",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly"
        },
        {
          "word": " Then,",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly"
        },
        {
          "word": " when",
          "start": 5558.88,
          "end": 5558.88,
          "speaker": "Following the Parents Blindly"
